WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
One French charity, «les Restos du Cœur»,

2
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:09.310
served over 161 million
meals in 2024 to 2025.

3
00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.520
About 1.3 million people were helped.

4
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.570
And about 108,000
volunteers made it happen.

5
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:21.710
Across France, about one person in
four gives time to «une association»,

6
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.430
from sports clubs to food banks.

7
00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.340
So who gains the most:

8
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.810
the people who are helped,

9
00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.610
or the people who help?

10
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:32.850
In this mission, you'll find
out who volunteers in France,

11
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.420
and how often.

12
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.930
Then you'll weigh what flows each
way between helper and helped.

13
00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.850
Your mission: work out
who gains the most when

14
00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.650
people give their time for free.
